WEBVTT

01:00.390 --> 01:07.220
It is said that 70% of the
human brain's capacity is unused.

01:09.230 --> 01:11.290
It's also thought that...

01:11.860 --> 01:15.060
...the mysterious powers that humans
have are hidden in this part of the brain.

01:17.000 --> 01:21.570
The 70% of the brain that is not used...

01:22.340 --> 01:24.070
...is often called this...

01:24.140 --> 01:29.880
<i>Night Head Genesis</i>

01:39.360 --> 01:40.260
What's happening?

01:43.400 --> 01:45.420
<i>Danger! Due to strong poison,
be careful when handling.</i>

01:53.740 --> 01:55.900
What's the word?
Did you stop the research?

01:56.380 --> 01:58.170
Yes, of course.

02:07.220 --> 02:08.350
<i>Nightmare</i>

02:08.350 --> 02:12.090
<i>Nightmare
Episode 11</i>

02:23.140 --> 02:24.330
Why are you lying?

02:24.400 --> 02:25.370
Lying?

02:25.970 --> 02:27.300
What was the lie?

02:28.970 --> 02:32.710
As I told you on the phone,
I disposed of all the data.

02:33.050 --> 02:34.410
I'm not lying.

02:35.880 --> 02:39.210
Excuse me, there is a break room
next door, so over there...

02:39.690 --> 02:41.020
It's fine right here.

02:42.720 --> 02:43.750
There you go.

02:44.360 --> 02:48.760
I gave up on the research
just like you told me to.

02:59.040 --> 03:00.100
Naoya!

03:00.870 --> 03:02.600
Get it together, Naoya! Are you okay?

03:02.840 --> 03:05.170
The data is still there.

03:05.580 --> 03:08.710
I was able to see the destruction of
the future more certainly than before!

03:10.620 --> 03:12.210
What's the matter all of a sudden?

03:12.750 --> 03:15.220
He will get better
right away if he lays down.

03:15.620 --> 03:17.150
Is there somewhere he can rest?

03:17.890 --> 03:20.360
There is a sofa in the break room.

03:25.360 --> 03:28.360
A dead body on the black sofa.

03:29.300 --> 03:30.360
What's the matter?

03:31.300 --> 03:32.240
Not here.

03:36.310 --> 03:37.280
Brother...

03:37.340 --> 03:40.010
I'm sorry. Please bear with it here.

03:41.410 --> 03:42.540
Excuse me...

03:42.850 --> 03:44.540
Because of the
virus's sudden mutation...

03:44.620 --> 03:46.610
...the disease is
going to spread from here.

03:46.820 --> 03:50.450
Once you find out that you can't stop it,
your fate is to commit suicide.

03:50.620 --> 03:52.590
What is this guy saying?

03:58.730 --> 04:00.890
For some reason, my throat is...

04:08.970 --> 04:10.410
No, Brother!

04:12.440 --> 04:13.430
Naoya?

04:16.750 --> 04:18.220
What's the matter, Naoya?

04:18.780 --> 04:21.880
There was poison in the coffee.

04:24.290 --> 04:24.950
Poison?

04:30.300 --> 04:32.030
M-Mr. Tadano...

04:32.430 --> 04:33.330
That's...

04:33.430 --> 04:35.090
Miss Kurahashi...

04:35.170 --> 04:37.800
...you were saying you wanted to
kill the person that rejected you.

04:38.400 --> 04:40.200
N-No!

04:40.610 --> 04:42.200
What am I saying!

04:43.910 --> 04:46.900
What is this?
My head is just blanking out.

04:47.380 --> 04:49.440
Mr. Tadano, get it together!

04:51.380 --> 04:52.320
Naoya?

04:58.290 --> 04:59.120
What's going on?

05:00.060 --> 05:01.960
There was someone
here till just now.

05:02.030 --> 05:02.690
What?

05:02.760 --> 05:04.390
But they're not here anymore.

05:07.800 --> 05:08.990
Why?

05:09.340 --> 05:11.200
Why did something like this happen?

05:11.570 --> 05:14.130
Whoever was in the
hallway made him do it.

05:14.710 --> 05:19.640
They used your feeling of hate
toward Brother and told this man.

05:20.310 --> 05:21.440
No way...

05:21.750 --> 05:23.270
Who is it? Kamiya?

05:24.050 --> 05:25.140
I don't know.

05:25.780 --> 05:27.180
I don't know who it is.

05:27.590 --> 05:29.180
That sort of thing can't be...

05:37.530 --> 05:41.300
Am I really going to bring mankind
to destruction with this experiment?

05:45.340 --> 05:47.270
Because you're not
giving in with your trifling...

05:47.340 --> 05:50.600
...and quitting the experiment,
everyone will die!

05:51.210 --> 05:52.680
You're going to kill them!

06:03.460 --> 06:04.750
Miss Kurahashi?

06:15.500 --> 06:18.660
<i>Deleting File_058
Please enter password</i>

06:19.510 --> 06:21.340
I will believe you guys.

06:21.740 --> 06:25.140
I will completely eliminate the data
and never put it in writing.

06:25.810 --> 06:28.340
I will also forget about the experiment.

06:28.880 --> 06:30.080
Miss Kurahashi...

06:30.820 --> 06:31.710
Is it okay now?

06:33.790 --> 06:36.880
<i>Deletion in progress</i>

06:37.390 --> 06:40.950
Miss Kurahashi, do you
understand what you just did?

06:44.530 --> 06:45.900
<i>"File_058" deletion complete</i>

07:12.390 --> 07:13.420
It's over.

07:16.660 --> 07:19.060
Naoya, who was in the hallway?

07:19.800 --> 07:21.060
I don't know.

07:21.430 --> 07:25.030
What kind of power is it
if they're able to do such a thing?

07:26.940 --> 07:28.430
Brother, this is bad!

07:29.040 --> 07:31.600
I forgot my glove at the lab!

07:32.380 --> 07:33.440
This is weird!

07:33.510 --> 07:37.570
That glove was supposed to stay
with me until it's totally torn apart!

07:38.080 --> 07:40.810
Don't say it like it's a living thing.

07:46.430 --> 07:47.290
What's wrong?

07:47.730 --> 07:48.750
It's not gone.

07:48.960 --> 07:51.230
The vision of destruction
didn't disappear!

07:51.300 --> 07:52.160
What!

07:52.430 --> 07:53.590
What do you mean!

07:53.670 --> 07:56.900
We need to go back!
Those gloves are calling us!

08:13.950 --> 08:15.150
Miss Kurahashi...

08:15.890 --> 08:16.910
What were you doing?

08:17.720 --> 08:19.520
Restoration of the data.

08:19.890 --> 08:21.050
Restoration?

08:21.360 --> 08:22.490
What do you mean?

08:25.160 --> 08:27.330
The data for the virus
activity control medication.

08:27.400 --> 08:28.700
What did you just say!

08:28.770 --> 08:30.500
Think about it!

08:30.600 --> 08:33.090
It might become the
wonder drug for AIDS!

08:33.170 --> 08:34.660
It's an amazing fortune.

08:34.740 --> 08:37.710
You want to make what we
worked for till now totally disappear?

08:38.180 --> 08:39.700
I can't believe it.

08:40.650 --> 08:43.240
If you don't want to, I will take it on.

08:43.320 --> 08:44.610
What are you saying?

08:44.850 --> 08:47.050
You say it like it's yours.

08:47.290 --> 08:49.650
You're just an assistant, right?

08:49.920 --> 08:51.250
Don't you get it?

08:51.520 --> 08:55.690
Those guys put me under hypnosis
and made me do what I did.

08:55.760 --> 08:58.160
Then they put you in shock and...

08:58.830 --> 09:00.590
It's not a supernatural power.

09:00.870 --> 09:02.360
It's just hypnosis!

09:02.700 --> 09:04.600
Delete the data right away!

09:06.640 --> 09:09.040
What an unreasonable woman!

09:09.110 --> 09:11.100
Let go! Let go of me!

09:11.840 --> 09:14.310
Why can't you listen to what I say!

09:14.450 --> 09:17.280
Even though you listen
to people like them!

09:17.750 --> 09:21.710
That guy is not someone
on such a small scale like you!

09:22.650 --> 09:23.810
Get rid of the data...

09:24.260 --> 09:25.150
Shut up!

09:25.560 --> 09:28.550
There is a huge fortune that's
being risked with that experiment!

09:28.630 --> 09:31.930
I was being manipulated before,
but now this is my own wish!

09:32.230 --> 09:33.460
Stop it!

09:38.100 --> 09:39.830
Please don't resist.

09:42.110 --> 09:43.570
S-Stop it!

09:43.940 --> 09:45.310
Making fun of me.

09:46.410 --> 09:47.400
Damn it!

09:51.950 --> 09:53.610
Please don't resist.

09:54.590 --> 09:55.480
I...

09:55.920 --> 09:56.950
You...

10:00.330 --> 10:01.350
What...

10:04.000 --> 10:05.190
Are you kidding?

10:12.800 --> 10:14.570
M-Mr. Tadano...

10:16.740 --> 10:18.770
You're Kanako Kurahashi, huh?

10:21.780 --> 10:22.910
Who are you?

10:41.370 --> 10:42.490
Stop it...

10:43.440 --> 10:44.530
Please...

10:50.510 --> 10:52.030
The Kirihara brothers!

10:52.110 --> 10:53.200
Die!

10:53.310 --> 10:54.140
Brother!

11:03.960 --> 11:04.850
Are you okay?

11:24.540 --> 11:25.670
It disappeared.

11:26.210 --> 11:29.040
The vision of the destruction
of mankind has disappeared.

11:55.670 --> 11:57.970
Are you in the middle of
delusion again, Kamiya?

11:59.140 --> 12:00.770
I'm joking.

12:01.580 --> 12:03.880
What's the matter, Chief Kurokawa?

12:05.480 --> 12:06.420
Yeah...

12:06.920 --> 12:09.680
Kamiya, I'm sorry
about the other day.

12:10.490 --> 12:12.050
Could you tell me one thing?

12:13.690 --> 12:15.820
How can I avoid death?

12:16.500 --> 12:17.720
Please tell me.

12:19.700 --> 12:22.500
Predictions are not 100 percent.

12:23.100 --> 12:26.300
They always have
the potential to change.

12:26.410 --> 12:27.460
Are you sure?

12:27.940 --> 12:28.600
Yes.

12:29.140 --> 12:33.130
Right now, a big prediction
just disappeared.

12:33.480 --> 12:35.410
Then mine too?

12:36.920 --> 12:39.510
Please get your heart
examined again.

12:40.020 --> 12:42.650
Also, hold back on
extraneous exercise.

12:43.160 --> 12:45.620
Thank you. I will do that.

12:56.740 --> 12:57.720
What's wrong?

12:58.640 --> 12:59.400
Nothing.

12:59.840 --> 13:03.800
I can't die until my kid goes to college.

13:04.580 --> 13:06.200
I will be careful.

13:06.750 --> 13:07.970
Thank you, Kamiya.

13:08.310 --> 13:09.210
See you.

13:13.120 --> 13:15.140
The future you cannot avoid...

13:34.070 --> 13:35.200
Well now...

13:36.740 --> 13:38.770
Because of you, someone died.

13:39.750 --> 13:42.540
As I thought, Kanako Kurahashi
passed away, huh?

13:42.880 --> 13:44.750
No, she's alive.

13:45.280 --> 13:47.340
The one that died
wasn't Kanako Kurahashi.

13:48.650 --> 13:53.490
But, the vision of mankind's destruction
disappeared this afternoon.

13:53.690 --> 13:56.160
Then who passed away?

13:56.460 --> 13:59.120
I thought someone died
on the black sofa.

13:59.200 --> 14:00.430
Was it Sakota?

14:00.800 --> 14:01.790
No.

14:02.230 --> 14:04.100
The assistant Tadano.

14:04.240 --> 14:05.760
He died on top of the sofa.

14:06.100 --> 14:07.940
Weren't you there too?

14:08.910 --> 14:10.340
What are you talking about?

14:10.440 --> 14:13.740
You were the one that made Tadano
make coffee with poison in it, right?

14:14.550 --> 14:15.770
No!

14:16.110 --> 14:17.450
It's not him!

14:18.120 --> 14:19.810
Poisoned coffee?

14:20.320 --> 14:24.120
I see, that's why we
saw the white powder.

14:25.020 --> 14:27.620
How did this man
named Tadano die?

14:28.390 --> 14:30.220
He was shot with
a bowgun and died.

14:30.800 --> 14:33.960
The silver snake was
symbolizing that bow.

14:34.370 --> 14:37.460
Then as I suspected,
the two men were you guys.

14:38.070 --> 14:41.130
I was able to see the black gloves
that your brother is wearing.

14:41.310 --> 14:43.570
Everything was as I predicted.

14:44.610 --> 14:47.770
The person that was moved by
your prediction who killed someone...

14:47.850 --> 14:49.680
...and the person that was killed.

14:50.050 --> 14:51.980
This is all the catastrophe
you threw around.

14:52.720 --> 14:54.650
But mankind was saved.

14:56.350 --> 14:58.450
What are you trying to do with me?

14:58.890 --> 15:00.720
We can't do anything.

15:01.360 --> 15:02.830
We never want to see you again.

15:03.300 --> 15:04.350
Let's go, Naoya.

15:07.870 --> 15:09.030
Please hold on a second.

15:14.910 --> 15:17.640
You guys are going to
reunite with your parents.

15:17.710 --> 15:18.680
What!

15:19.740 --> 15:20.540
Is that true?

15:21.150 --> 15:22.880
And I see a desert...

15:29.250 --> 15:31.920
There is a girl standing in the desert.

15:32.090 --> 15:33.250
Shouko?

15:37.300 --> 15:38.350
Ark...

15:39.360 --> 15:40.990
What is Ark?

15:41.500 --> 15:42.520
Ark?

15:45.740 --> 15:47.730
Reiko was saying...

15:47.910 --> 15:51.870
...A- Ark was chasing after her.

15:52.780 --> 15:53.800
Brother...

15:54.510 --> 15:56.040
I can't see anything anymore.

15:56.650 --> 16:00.710
Maybe my predictions
came in handy for you guys?

16:01.290 --> 16:05.380
If the prediction actually comes true,
please tell me too.

16:08.560 --> 16:09.930
What's the matter?

16:11.660 --> 16:13.760
You just saw something, didn't you?

16:14.900 --> 16:15.630
Naoya.

16:16.030 --> 16:18.130
Is it about my future?

16:18.800 --> 16:19.960
I don't mind.

16:20.340 --> 16:21.500
Please say it.

16:21.910 --> 16:22.870
Go ahead.

16:24.110 --> 16:25.670
The shadow of death is...

16:29.810 --> 16:31.210
Let's go, Naoya.

16:36.720 --> 16:39.210
There was no
golden elephant anywhere.

16:39.690 --> 16:40.890
Please be careful.

17:21.700 --> 17:25.800
Good evening,
great teacher Tsukasa Kamiya.

17:26.100 --> 17:30.300
Did you enjoy my magical present?

17:30.780 --> 17:33.540
This is... a strange dream.

17:34.080 --> 17:38.140
Why a dream like this?

17:38.680 --> 17:44.590
I'm making you see it, great teacher.

17:46.360 --> 17:47.760
Who are you?

17:48.130 --> 17:49.820
I am Sonezaki.

17:49.960 --> 17:53.520
This other one is Mr. Asano.
He's a record keeper.

17:54.070 --> 17:57.190
Everything he sees
is recorded into his brain.

17:57.300 --> 18:00.470
I guess you can say
he's like a human television.

18:00.810 --> 18:02.500
My goodness...

18:03.340 --> 18:04.740
Do you get it?

18:04.910 --> 18:08.400
I'm working directly into your brain.

18:11.920 --> 18:15.110
You remember seeing this, right?

18:20.860 --> 18:24.520
Today, you saved
mankind from destruction.

18:24.830 --> 18:27.760
It's a reward. I'll let you drink this.

18:28.100 --> 18:31.360
It's the world's sweetest sugar.

18:31.440 --> 18:33.560
Here, open wide.

18:37.040 --> 18:41.100
Kamiya, your job is already done.

18:59.960 --> 19:04.530
The criminal was an enthusiastic
believer in Tsukasa Kamiya.

19:05.070 --> 19:07.400
We don't know if he had
the same information we did, but...

19:07.470 --> 19:10.340
...last night, the Heisei era's
predictor Tsukasa Kamiya...

19:10.410 --> 19:13.670
...committed suicide by
taking poison at his apartment.

19:14.380 --> 19:15.900
He really died.

19:16.780 --> 19:18.340
I can't believe that it was suicide.

19:19.380 --> 19:22.720
He's not the type of person
to commit suicide.

19:23.120 --> 19:25.060
Something had to have
happened after that.

19:25.120 --> 19:27.320
What do you mean by something?

19:37.500 --> 19:38.130
What is it?

19:38.340 --> 19:40.800
Kamiya Tsukasa died.

19:41.370 --> 19:43.700
Kanako Kurahashi's
assistant died, but...

19:43.780 --> 19:46.070
...all the other security and
staff members that were shot...

19:46.140 --> 19:48.670
...with the bow gun escaped death.

19:49.110 --> 19:52.480
Sakota is claiming you
for inflicting bodily injury, but...

19:52.550 --> 19:54.580
...most likely nothing will happen.

19:55.320 --> 19:57.550
Did Tsukasa Kamiya commit suicide?

19:58.260 --> 20:01.190
All the circumstantial evidence
is pointing to suicide.

20:01.460 --> 20:03.430
But a child from
the same apartment...

20:03.500 --> 20:07.020
...has said that he saw
a man with black gloves on.

20:07.870 --> 20:12.000
Well, it's a 5-year-old child, so it
won't be any kind of evidence though.

20:12.800 --> 20:16.470
When I say suicide, there's an incident
that comes to your mind, right?

20:17.480 --> 20:18.970
Is it mind control?

20:19.640 --> 20:20.410
Yeah.

20:21.410 --> 20:23.380
That's right. That time...

20:24.020 --> 20:26.310
My throat got really dry at the lab.

20:26.890 --> 20:29.720
I wanted to drink
that ice coffee so badly.

20:30.020 --> 20:31.110
The poisoned one...

20:32.920 --> 20:35.650
The person that
was there at that time...

20:38.000 --> 20:39.020
That's right.

20:39.230 --> 20:41.290
The one that killed Kamiya
is that person.

20:41.470 --> 20:43.300
It's someone that has
considerable power.

20:43.370 --> 20:44.360
Who is it!

20:44.600 --> 20:46.900
It's most likely Michio Sonezaki.

20:47.340 --> 20:49.470
Michio Sonezaki?

20:49.940 --> 20:52.070
We're going after
his whereabouts too...

20:52.140 --> 20:57.100
Even though it's not like once we
find out we can do anything though.

20:58.450 --> 21:01.580
Eventually, he will
reach out to you guys too.

21:02.290 --> 21:03.150
Why?

21:03.320 --> 21:05.350
I just have that premonition.

21:05.860 --> 21:07.920
We can't count on your premonition.

21:08.630 --> 21:09.350
Naoto...

21:10.230 --> 21:11.530
Be careful.

21:21.710 --> 21:23.300
This is Sonezaki.

21:23.540 --> 21:24.840
Job well done.

21:25.210 --> 21:29.010
Asano showed me all of
the record of your job.

21:29.080 --> 21:31.170
It was a fun job.

21:31.550 --> 21:32.480
Really...

21:32.550 --> 21:33.710
I'm glad.

21:34.290 --> 21:38.690
But with those brothers,
it wouldn't go as planned.

21:39.360 --> 21:41.330
No, that was fine.

21:41.830 --> 21:45.190
It was important to be able to
figure out their powers.

21:45.500 --> 21:47.730
They are uncertain data.

21:48.130 --> 21:49.930
Uncertain data?

21:50.000 --> 21:53.060
There is going to be another job soon.

21:53.240 --> 21:55.370
I'll contact you again.

22:00.880 --> 22:02.850
Uncertain data...

22:29.910 --> 22:38.710
<i>I hope that everything that
makes you sad will all disappear.</i>

22:38.780 --> 22:47.560
<i>The words that I said that day
are still tightening my chest.</i>

22:47.630 --> 22:56.400
<i>A single shadow looked like light
in this world that I'm imprisoned in.</i>

22:56.470 --> 23:05.210
<i>The rain of May became lighter
as it was kindly shining tomorrow.</i>

23:05.280 --> 23:09.610
<i>I lost the meaning of smiling...</i>

23:09.680 --> 23:13.980
<i>... that day I thought I
lost my place to be.</i>

23:14.050 --> 23:18.420
<i>I wished for your warmth.</i>

23:18.490 --> 23:22.930
<i>We have stopped time.</i>

23:23.160 --> 23:27.260
<i>I had this feeling it was
eventually going to come, but...</i>

23:27.330 --> 23:31.890
<i>... I pretended I didn't know
and buried my loneliness.</i>

23:31.970 --> 23:42.070
<i>I looked down at your feet as the
droplets describing "Good-bye" fell.</i>

23:42.710 --> 23:51.450
<i>I hope that everything that
makes you sad will all disappear.</i>

23:51.520 --> 23:59.900
<i>The words that I said that day
are still tightening my chest.</i>

24:01.030 --> 24:04.730
Kindness called indebtedness
that is in the corner of the heart.

24:05.770 --> 24:09.370
The ghost named illusion
that imposes on this.

24:11.080 --> 24:16.310
The one that appears before the two of us
who is mournful with a ruthless smile.

24:17.680 --> 24:20.580
That is the one who wears
the true darkness.

24:21.190 --> 24:22.910
Poppy of darkness...

24:23.990 --> 24:29.850
<i>Episode 12, "Bewilderment."</i>

24:25.920 --> 24:29.290
Where are we headed?
